# Recorded footage and build intermediates.
#
# The tapes, the Remotion cut and build.sh are the sources and are tracked; the
# footage they produce is not. Acts are re-recordable (`./build.sh --record`) and
# live agents make every take different anyway, so committing one would freeze an
# arbitrary take as if it were canonical. The *published* assets do get
# committed — they live in site/assets and docs/screenshots.
act1.mp4
act2.mp4
act3.mp4
act1.gif
act2.gif
act3.gif
dist/
render/node_modules/
render/public/*.mp4
